5. Using Wrong Attribute Names
Mistake:
- Forgetting the double underscore for private attributes (__copy_id)
- Forgetting the single underscore for protected ones (_condition)
- These naming conventions are part of data hiding and should be followed.
11. Comparing Dates Incorrectly
Mistake:
